001080r 2               ;	Y,A POINTS AT COEFFICIENT TABLE
001080r 2               ;	FIRST BYTE OF COEFF. TABLE IS N
001080r 2               ;	COEFFICIENTS FOLLOW, HIGHEST POWER FIRST
